ordinary_real_inverse.jl is a modified real-only Julia translation of
RuQing Xu's xrq-phys/Pfaffine invert.tcc, bundled by mVMC 1.4.0 (unchanged since 1.3.0), and the
MPL-2.0 Julia port PfaPack.jl/src/utu2.jl by Terasaki/Misawa.
Origin invert.tcc SHA256 d477c7d2bb6d2b0c29872d06ec75fd7e804e1e30ace00888b77d31d2c74b821c.
sktdsmx origin lines11-28; utu2inv upper pipeline lines76-120.
The source-adjacent ordinary_real_inverse.LICENSE reproduces MPL-2.0.
Modification: private ordinary-real scalar divisions replace reciprocal
multiplication; the existing TRTRI/copy/solve/column-permute/TRMM/row-permute
sequence remains unchanged. No PfaPack methods are extended or replaced.
